    "# 3. Target Construction\n",
    "\n",
    "This step decides which loans count as **Good** (target = 0) and which count as **Bad** (target = 1). The dissertation §3.4.1 commits to terminal-state-only labels, which means anything that hasn't finished its life (`Current`, `Issued`, `In Grace Period`, the two `Late (...)` buckets) is dropped from the modelling table entirely.\n",
    "\n",
    "| Class | Loan statuses included |\n",
    "|---|---|\n",
    "| **Good (0)** | `Fully Paid`, `Does not meet the credit policy. Status:Fully Paid` |\n",
    "| **Bad (1)**  | `Charged Off`, `Default`, `Does not meet the credit policy. Status:Charged Off` |\n",
    "| **Dropped**  | `Current`, `Issued`, `In Grace Period`, `Late (16-30 days)`, `Late (31-120 days)` |\n"
   ]
